SUMMARY:Kayaking Lake Julian
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n**Hey y’all! Let’s meet at Lake** *
 *Julian Park** **with** **our** **kayaks and paddle boards\, and** **spend
 ** **some time on the water!** **We’ll meet at the boat landing at 9:30 
 am for unloading. We’ll plan to hit the water by 10:00 am**\n\n**We will
  leave the boat landing and paddle to the south end of the lake\, through 
 the canal. Coming back\, we will explore the east section of the** **lake.
  On the return trip will** **beach our** **boats over at** **Wild Wing** *
 *Café\, and go up for food and drink.** **After we finish there\, it’s 
 a short paddle back to the landing. Hope to see y’all there!!**\n\n**htt
 ps://www.buncombenc.gov/Facilities/Facility/Details/Lake-Julian-Park-6**\n
 \n**A day pass for boating is $8.00**\n\n**What you need:**\n\n**Kayak or 
 paddle board**\n**Life jacket**\n**Sun screen**\n**Plenty of drinking wate
 r**\n**Safety whistle**\n\n**I believe you can rent a paddle board at the 
 boat landing. I’ll follow up to be sure**
